{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "1KI",
  "chapter": 17,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "1KI.17.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.17.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Elijah the Tishbite ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "who was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of the inhabitants of Gilead, said to Ahab, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "As",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD God of Israel liveth, before whom I stand, there shall not be dew nor rain these years, but according to my word.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.17.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.17.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the word of the LORD came to him, saying,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.17.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.17.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Depart hence, and turn thee eastward, and hide thyself by the brook Cherith, that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " before Jordan.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.17.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.17.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And it shall be, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thou shalt drink of the brook; and I have commanded the ravens to feed thee there.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.17.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.17.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So he went and did according to the word of the LORD: for he went and dwelt by the brook Cherith, that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " before Jordan.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.17.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.17.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the ravens brought him bread and flesh in the morning, and bread and flesh in the evening; and he drank of the brook.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.17.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.17.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass after a while, that the brook dried up, because there had been no rain in the land.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.17.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.17.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the word of the LORD came to him, saying,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.17.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.17.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Arise, go to Zarephath, which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "belongeth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to Zidon, and dwell there: behold, I have commanded a widow woman there to sustain thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.17.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.17.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So he arose and went to Zarephath. And when he came to the gate of the city, behold, the widow woman ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " there gathering sticks: and he called to her, and said, Bring me, I pray thee, a little water in a vessel, that I may drink.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.17.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.17.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And as she was going to bring ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", he called to her, and said, Bring me, I pray thee, a morsel of bread in thy hand.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.17.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.17.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And she said, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "As",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD thy God liveth, I have not a cake, but a handful of meal in a barrel, and a little oil in a cruse: and behold, I ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " gathering two sticks, that I may go in and dress it for me and my son, that we may eat it, and die.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.17.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.17.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Elijah said to her, Fear not; go ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " do as thou hast said: but make me of it a little cake first, and bring ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to me, and afterward make for thee and for thy son.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.17.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.17.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For thus saith the LORD God of Israel, The barrel of meal shall not waste, neither shall the cruse of oil fail, until the day ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD sendeth rain upon the earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.17.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.17.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And she went and did according to the saying of Elijah: and she, and he, and her house, did eat ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "many",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " days.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.17.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.17.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the barrel of meal wasted not, neither did the cruse of oil fail, according to the word of the LORD, which he spoke by Elijah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.17.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.17.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass after these things ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the son of the woman, the mistress of the house, fell sick; and his sickness was so severe, that there was no breath left in him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.17.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.17.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And she said to Elijah, What have I to do with thee, O thou man of God? art thou come to me to call my sin to remembrance, and to slay my son?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.17.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.17.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he said to her, Give me thy son. And he took him out of her bosom, and carried him up into a loft, where he abode, and laid him upon his own bed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.17.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.17.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he cried to the LORD, and said, O LORD my God, hast thou also brought evil upon the widow with whom I sojourn, by slaying her son?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.17.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.17.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he stretched himself upon the child three times, and cried to the LORD, and said, O LORD my God, I pray thee, let this child's soul come into him again.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.17.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.17.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the LORD heard the voice of Elijah; and the soul of the child came into him again, and he revived.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.17.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.17.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Elijah took the child, and brought him down from the chamber into the house, and delivered him to his mother: and Elijah said, See, thy son liveth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.17.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.17.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the woman said to Elijah, Now by this I know that thou ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "art",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a man of God, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " that the word of the LORD in thy mouth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " truth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
